    <string name="speed_help_title">How to Play Speed</string>
    <string name="speed_help_text">Race to play all your cards.

There are no turns. Put a card from your hand on either centre pile when it is exactly one rank higher or lower (the ace is next to both the king and the two). Your hand refills from your draw pile.

If neither of you can play, press Flip: new cards turn up in the centre. The first player to play every card of their hand and draw pile wins.

Turn-based assist, in the game setup, removes the clock: you take turns and can pass when stuck. It is also the best way to play with a screen reader.</string>
